WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.228
The Carters were sitting in a theater.

2
00:00:05.229 --> 00:00:11.148
They were waiting for a play to start.

3
00:00:11.149 --> 00:00:15.389
"I have to go to the bathroom," Oliver said.

4
00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:18.174
"I'll take you," Dad said.

5
00:00:18.175 --> 00:00:22.644
"I'll come too," Harry said.

6
00:00:22.645 --> 00:00:25.902
"Don't get lost," Emmy said.

7
00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:34.639
"This theater is really big!"

8
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.789
The theater began to grow dark.

9
00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:44.017
Dad and Oliver returned to their seats.

10
00:00:44.018 --> 00:00:49.145
"Where's Harry?" Mom asked.

11
00:00:49.146 --> 00:00:53.288
"I thought he came back here," Dad said.

12
00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:57.711
"Maybe he's lost," Emmy said.

13
00:00:57.712 --> 00:01:02.099
The curtain began to rise.

14
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:08.838
"The play is starting!" Oliver said.

15
00:01:08.839 --> 00:01:12.802
A princess was sitting in a garden.

16
00:01:12.803 --> 00:01:19.029
A handsome knight came to visit her.

17
00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:23.349
Mom looked around.

18
00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:27.263
"I'm worried about Harry," she whispered.

19
00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:30.097
"Where is he?"

20
00:01:30.098 --> 00:01:34.014
Suddenly a trapdoor opened on the stage.

21
00:01:34.015 --> 00:01:38.439
Out popped Harry!

22
00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:43.592
"There he is!" Oliver said in a loud voice.

23
00:01:43.593 --> 00:01:46.932
"Hello, Harry!"

24
00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:54.174
Everyone in the audience laughed.

25
00:01:54.175 --> 00:01:58.917
The princess and the knight looked surprised.

26
00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:02.417
Harry looked surprised too.

27
00:02:02.418 --> 00:02:06.639
"We have a visitor!" the knight said.

28
00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:12.121
"Are you looking for the castle?" the princess asked Harry.

29
00:02:12.122 --> 00:02:14.935
"I'll show you the way."

30
00:02:14.936 --> 00:02:23.450
The princess led Harry offstage.

31
00:02:23.451 --> 00:02:29.175
Harry returned to his seat.

32
00:02:29.176 --> 00:02:33.812
"You were in the play!" Oliver said.

33
00:02:33.813 --> 00:02:41.376
"No, Oliver, I was lost!" Harry said.

